WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,400
Lin Feng, are you there?

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:07,780
Did I read that right?

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:11,560
Why did the leader of Su University come to the door in person?

4
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,240
Do you also have to work in exchange for food?

5
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,560
I'm not here to beg.

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,040
I'm here to get some medicine for your hole.

7
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,080
It rained for two days

8
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,280
It’s strange if people don’t get sick

9
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,640
Tell me, who is sick? Sister Yao is sick.

10
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,880
Do you have any medicine? One sentence

11
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:24,280
Yes, there is

12
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,280
But what would you give in exchange?

13
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,640
fruit wild vegetables

14
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,040
And that's all the clothes I'm wearing

15
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:32,610
Give this to you too

16
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,580
Just use this lighter

17
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,300
I know you can live on your own

18
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,260
But it’s definitely not as convenient as a lighter

19
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:40,930
This broken lighter doesn't have much oil left and can't be used a few times.

20
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:42,930
Just these things can't be exchanged for medicine

21
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:44,250
Chen Yao’s necklace will also be given to you.

22
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:45,610
That's worth 1.3 million

23
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:46,610
What's the use of being expensive?

24
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:50,890
Can it be turned into medicine or food? These are the least valuable things here.

25
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:53,170
So what are you going to do to get me to give up something in exchange?

26
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:55,540
What do I want you to say?

27
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,700
I want you to apologize to me in front of everyone and admit that you were wrong.

28
00:00:58,900 --> 00:00:59,860
As long as you can do it

29
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,860
Take the medicine as you wish
